Meta.DisplayName=Palworld Server Tool (PST)
Meta.Description=Web-based admin dashboard for a Palworld dedicated server - player/guild/Pal/backpack inspection, whitelist, automated backups, live map. Reads game data via RCON/REST API and by parsing the target server's Saved folder directly. Requires an existing Palworld dedicated server with RCON and REST API enabled.
Meta.OS=Linux
Meta.AarchSupport=Unknown
Meta.Arch=x86_64
Meta.Author=zaigie (template packaged by Comsicare)
Meta.URL=https://github.com/zaigie/palworld-server-tool
